WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.867 --> 00:00:24.359
After the party everyone on board the ship finally went to sleep—but not the Little Mermaid.

2
00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:30.292
She knew that she would turn into sea foam at the first rays of dawn light.

3
00:00:30.293 --> 00:00:35.161
So she stayed on deck and looked out at the sea and the stars.

4
00:00:35.162 --> 00:00:43.338
"My Prince, my soul, and my future—they're all gone now," she thought.

5
00:00:43.339 --> 00:00:50.537
Minutes before the sun appeared, the Little Mermaid noticed some movement in the water near the ship.

6
00:00:50.538 --> 00:00:57.428
Suddenly she saw five figures rising from the waves, waving to her.

7
00:00:57.429 --> 00:01:01.451
The Little Mermaid didn't recognize her sisters right away.

8
00:01:01.452 --> 00:01:04.941
Their long and lovely hair was gone.

9
00:01:04.942 --> 00:01:08.862
Together they swam close to where she stood.

10
00:01:08.863 --> 00:01:13.352
Their heads bobbed above the water as they spoke.

11
00:01:13.353 --> 00:01:17.611
"We're here to save you!" cried the eldest sister.

12
00:01:17.612 --> 00:01:23.615
"When we found out about the Prince's wedding, we went straight to the Sea Witch for help."

13
00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:29.855
The second sister explained, "She gave us a magic dagger that will save your life.

14
00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:33.742
In exchange she demanded our hair."

15
00:01:33.743 --> 00:01:39.303
The third sister told the Little Mermaid what the witch had instructed them to do.

16
00:01:39.304 --> 00:01:45.683
"Before the sun rises, you must plunge the sharp blade into the Prince's heart.

17
00:01:45.684 --> 00:01:50.315
Once he is dead, you will become a mermaid again."

18
00:01:50.316 --> 00:01:52.804
The Little Mermaid trembled.

19
00:01:52.805 --> 00:01:57.137
"But I don't want to hurt my Prince," she thought.

20
00:01:57.138 --> 00:02:01.518
When the Little Mermaid hesitated, the fourth sister added,

21
00:02:01.519 --> 00:02:05.279
"Please, Sister, you must kill him to save yourself.

22
00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:08.599
Then you can come home with us."

23
00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:11.781
The fifth sister spoke for them all.

24
00:02:11.782 --> 00:02:13.473
"We all miss you.

25
00:02:13.474 --> 00:02:17.099
Our grandmother and father are waiting for you.

26
00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:20.277
You belong in the Sea Kingdom."

27
00:02:20.278 --> 00:02:26.561
"But I wanted my life to be different," the Little Mermaid thought sadly.

28
00:02:26.562 --> 00:02:32.706
The eldest sister yelled impatiently, "Hurry! You must be quick.

29
00:02:32.707 --> 00:02:34.388
It's almost daybreak.

30
00:02:34.389 --> 00:02:36.694
Kill the Prince now!"

31
00:02:36.695 --> 00:02:42.995
She threw the dagger up into the air, and the Little Mermaid caught the knife easily.

32
00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:50.228
"Please hurry, Sister!" cried the five mermaids as they dived back beneath the waves.

33
00:02:50.229 --> 00:02:53.333
The Little Mermaid looked at the knife.

34
00:02:53.334 --> 00:02:56.455
She was uncertain about what to do.

35
00:02:56.456 --> 00:03:00.861
This gift had cost her sisters their beautiful hair.

36
00:03:00.862 --> 00:03:05.896
They had given her a last chance to save herself.

37
00:03:05.897 --> 00:03:11.743
The Little Mermaid crept up to the royal tent and parted the curtains.

38
00:03:11.744 --> 00:03:18.534
She stepped lightly inside and saw her Prince with his arms around his new bride.

39
00:03:18.535 --> 00:03:21.658
They were both fast asleep.

40
00:03:21.659 --> 00:03:26.037
The Little Mermaid felt both anger and tenderness.

41
00:03:26.038 --> 00:03:32.363
Through the thin cloth of the tent, she saw that the morning sun was about to rise.

42
00:03:32.364 --> 00:03:34.111
Time was running out.

43
00:03:34.112 --> 00:03:37.711
Her chance was almost gone.

44
00:03:37.712 --> 00:03:42.922
She looked at the dagger and then at the handsome face of the sleeping Prince.

45
00:03:42.923 --> 00:03:46.139
It was either her life or his.

46
00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:50.992
She lowered the knife close to his heart but then stopped.

47
00:03:50.993 --> 00:03:54.468
"How can I kill him?" she thought.

48
00:03:54.469 --> 00:03:56.430
"I love my Prince.

49
00:03:56.431 --> 00:04:02.159
He must live, even if I must die."

50
00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:08.375
So the Little Mermaid ran out of the tent and flung the knife into the waves.

51
00:04:08.376 --> 00:04:13.900
Then she threw herself over the side of the ship and into the sea.

52
00:04:13.901 --> 00:04:19.959
She thought she could feel her body dissolving into thousands of bubbles of sea foam.

53
00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:29.112
Soon the Little Mermaid would be no more.
